<title>USA: Campo to file Chap 11, close nine stores.</title>
<headline>Campo to file Chap 11, close nine stores.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campo Electronics, Appliances and Computers Inc on Wednesday said its board of directors devised a turnaround plan that involves filing for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection and the closing of nine unprofitable stores and one distribution center.</p>
<p>Twenty stores, including all of its outlets in the New Orleans area, and two distribution centers will remain in operation, Campo said.</p>
<p>The company has arranged additional working capital to fund adequate inventory, updated store fixtures and a new information system, Campo said.</p>
</text>
